{{ if not .desktop }}
# ── hosts with no graphical session: desktop-session machinery only ──
# (BOX-169/170. `desktop` is its own axis, independent of `headless`: these
# are trees that are *useless without a graphical session*, as opposed to
# trees whose tool is simply not installed here. Membership test: if this
# host had a screen and the tool were installed, would the file matter?
# No → it belongs here. macOS-only trees are OS-gated above.)
